  "part_of_speech": "noun / suru-verb",
  "gloss": "consideration, taking into account",
  "conjugation": {
    "type": "suru",
    "prefix": "{考慮|こうりょ}"
  },
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "consideration, deliberation",
      "explanation": "Careful thought about something before making a decision."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "02752_kouryo_ex1",
      "japanese": "{安全|あんぜん}{性|せい}を{考慮|こうりょ}して{設計|せっけい}した。",
      "english": "It was designed with safety in mind.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "02752_kouryo_ex2",
      "japanese": "その{点|てん}は{考慮|こうりょ}に{入|い}れていなかった。",
      "english": "I hadn't taken that point into consideration.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "02752_kouryo_ex3",
      "japanese": "{予算|よさん}を{考慮|こうりょ}すると、このプランは{難|むずか}しい。",
      "english": "Considering the budget, this plan is difficult.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "02752_kouryo_ex4",
      "japanese": "{様々|さまざま}な{要素|ようそ}を{考慮|こうりょ}した{上|うえ}で、{最終|さいしゅう}{決定|けってい}を{下|くだ}す{必要|ひつよう}がある。",
      "english": "We need to make the final decision after considering various factors.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "{考慮|こうりょ} means to consider or take into account.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]を{考慮|こうりょ}する\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜を{考慮|こうりょ}する (to consider ~)\n- 〜を{考慮|こうりょ}に{入|い}れる (to take ~ into consideration)\n- {考慮|こうりょ}した{上|うえ}で (after considering)\n- {考慮|こうりょ}に{値|あたい}する (worth considering)\n\nFORMAL EXPRESSIONS:\n- {考慮|こうりょ}の{結果|けっか} (as a result of consideration)\n- {十分|じゅうぶん}に{考慮|こうりょ}する (to fully consider)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {考慮|こうりょ}: consideration (formal, deliberate)\n- {検討|けんとう}: examination, review\n- {配慮|はいりょ}: consideration, thoughtfulness (for others)",
